{"5356850":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Arauto","steam_appid":5356850,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer the board, one turn at a time<\/h2>Arauto is a classic-style board game of territorial conquest, rebuilt to be played online. Place your armies, attack your neighbours with the dice, hold whole continents for extra reinforcements and trade territory cards for ever larger armies, all while chasing a secret objective that only you know.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two ways to play<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Classic<\/strong>: the real world map, with 42 territories and 6 continents. Every player is a colour.<br><\/li><li><strong>Mythic<\/strong>: the fantasy world of <strong>Ancalora<\/strong> and the larger board of <strong>Asterra<\/strong>, with 54 territories and 8 realms. Every player leads one of 10 races, from knights and elves to dragons, the undead and fairy riders. Optional race passives give each race a trait of its own.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online matches for 3 to 6 players, in public or password-protected rooms<br><\/li><li>Play against friends, bots or both, with bots in two difficulty levels<br><\/li><li>Secret objectives: conquer continents, hold territories or wipe out a rival army<br><\/li><li>Territory cards with growing trades, continent bonuses and dice battles with up to three dice on each side<br><\/li><li>Drop out and come back: your match waits for you<br><\/li><li>A profile with your career: wins, races, maps and objectives completed<br><\/li><li>10 Steam achievements<br><\/li><li>Built-in rules, match log and chat<br><\/li><li>In seven languages: English, Brazilian Portuguese, Latin American Spanish, Simplified Chinese, Russian, German and French<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access<\/h2>Arauto is made by a solo developer and grows with its players. More maps, races and modes are on the way.","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer the board, one turn at a time<\/h2>Arauto is a classic-style board game of territorial conquest, rebuilt to be played online. Place your armies, attack your neighbours with the dice, hold whole continents for extra reinforcements and trade territory cards for ever larger armies, all while chasing a secret objective that only you know.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two ways to play<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Classic<\/strong>: the real world map, with 42 territories and 6 continents. Every player is a colour.<br><\/li><li><strong>Mythic<\/strong>: the fantasy world of <strong>Ancalora<\/strong> and the larger board of <strong>Asterra<\/strong>, with 54 territories and 8 realms. Every player leads one of 10 races, from knights and elves to dragons, the undead and fairy riders. Optional race passives give each race a trait of its own.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online matches for 3 to 6 players, in public or password-protected rooms<br><\/li><li>Play against friends, bots or both, with bots in two difficulty levels<br><\/li><li>Secret objectives: conquer continents, hold territories or wipe out a rival army<br><\/li><li>Territory cards with growing trades, continent bonuses and dice battles with up to three dice on each side<br><\/li><li>Drop out and come back: your match waits for you<br><\/li><li>A profile with your career: wins, races, maps and objectives completed<br><\/li><li>10 Steam achievements<br><\/li><li>Built-in rules, match log and chat<br><\/li><li>In seven languages: English, Brazilian Portuguese, Latin American Spanish, Simplified Chinese, Russian, German and French<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access<\/h2>Arauto is made by a solo developer and grows with its players. More maps, races and modes are on the way.","short_description":"Arauto is a turn-based board game of territorial conquest for 3 to 6 players, online against friends or bots. Roll the dice, hold continents, trade cards and chase a secret objective on the real world map or in the mythic realms of Ancalora and Asterra.","supported_languages":"Portuguese - Brazil, English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Russian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5356850\/e5827692bbf8311a0a9e7ce44120e614c3977279\/header.jpg?t=1793733176","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5356850\/5e5335e361aa9e79495de8fc14a2cc5504804ccb\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793733176","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5356850\/5e5335e361aa9e79495de8fc14a2cc5504804ccb\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793733176","website":"https:\/\/arauto.thira-app.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated graphics with DirectX 11 support<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires an Internet connection to play (online matches).<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 2.5 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated graphics with 1 GB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5